licence text lives.

Art and models
--------------

KayKit Character Pack: Adventures 1.0 and KayKit Medieval Hexagon Pack 1.0 by Kay Lousberg; Poly Haven textures
(rendered into the pictures of the demo mod jar)
  CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication).
  Sources and licence references: mods/demo/THIRD-PARTY.md (carried in demo.jar).

Fonts
-----

The repository and its distributions ship no third-party font. The demo font is drawn for the project (mods/demo/src/assets/svg/fonts).

